sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Client

    box Node.js service
        participant Node as receive-event-http-api<br/>Service code
        participant Validate as event-jianding<br/>npm package
        participant NodeForward as service-fasong<br/>npm package
    end

    box Python service
        participant Python as process-event-http-api<br/>Service code
        participant Enrich as event-fengfu<br/>Python package
        participant PyForward as service-zhuanfa<br/>Python package
    end

    box Java service
        participant Java as aggregate-event-http-api<br/>Service code
        participant Aggregate as event-juhe<br/>Maven package
        participant Response as result-fanhui<br/>Maven package
    end

    Client->>+Node: POST /events<br/>Original event JSON

    Node->>+Validate: validateEvent(event)
    Validate-->>-Node: Validation result

    Node->>+NodeForward: forwardEvent(PYTHON_SERVICE_URL, event)
    NodeForward->>+Python: POST /process<br/>Original event JSON

    Python->>+Enrich: enrich_event(event)
    Enrich-->>-Python: enriched_event

    Python->>+PyForward: forward_event(JAVA_SERVICE_URL, enriched_event)
    PyForward->>+Java: POST /aggregate<br/>Enriched event JSON

    Java->>+Aggregate: aggregate(counterState, enriched_event)
    Aggregate-->>-Java: AggregationResult(updated_event, updated_state)

    Note right of Java: counterState = result.state()

    Java->>+Response: wrap(result.event(), result.state())
    Response-->>-Java: aggregated_response

    Java-->>-PyForward: HTTP 200<br/>Aggregated-response JSON
    PyForward-->>-Python: Parsed downstream response

    Python-->>-NodeForward: HTTP 200<br/>Python-response JSON
    NodeForward-->>-Node: Parsed downstream response

    Node-->>-Client: HTTP 200<br/>Final nested-response JSON